 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "vo01",
   "beat": "hook",
   "text": "Every hair on you is scheduled to fall out.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "01.wav",
   "dur": 3.55,
   "sha256": "fb2aa9e3aa032cd9c8343c09a47898a073ade9364f088f3fdf461adb0293c55b"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo02",
   "beat": "normal",
   "text": "Every hair on your body is quietly keeping time.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "02.wav",
   "dur": 3.73,
   "sha256": "621a4ae3cf9288a3ebe0805bed8332b688a68051b8512ce1c1c64da455aa650d"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo03",
   "beat": "change",
   "text": "It grows, it pauses, it rests, and then… it lets go.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "03.wav",
   "dur": 5.93,
   "sha256": "458505355546ecfc30fab9b773bdbddf53e4a433d0f3504bc35c1f37bd3f7dd3"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo04",
   "beat": "why",
   "text": "On your head, growing can last for years. That's why it can grow so long.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "04.wav",
   "dur": 7.09,
   "sha256": "81d023b3b6debb7e30a68121ae259786f8142c88bc6dc507611dcbf1e6473972"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo05",
   "beat": "why",
   "text": "On your eyebrow, it lasts only months. They stay short.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "05.wav",
   "dur": 6.25,
   "sha256": "490e8efbc2509fa8747cf0e80eeef1a5fa73707d2df0ba84b2b95880a767d9fe"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo06",
   "beat": "whoa",
   "text": "When growing ends, the root shrinks and the hair loosens. Then it rests for a couple months.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "06.wav",
   "dur": 8.89,
   "sha256": "c4bb9ec02bf2cdc4efe52c1302c384be9eb7126ed8d4aa0d64cc4c509714b9fb"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo07",
   "beat": "whoa",
   "text": "Meanwhile, in the same follicle, a brand new hair begins… and gently pushes the old one out.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "07.wav",
   "dur": 8.99,
   "sha256": "c199c22734813662972c8ba4b575e6dfa6ad3d78c7edf645f6f9602ba244c725"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo08",
   "beat": "takeaway",
   "text": "So losing fifty to a hundred hairs a day from your head alone is normal.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "08.wav",
   "dur": 6.01,
   "sha256": "6c20d7fc1fedaf898ffa6c94f8372f0f6989eade6589315b796c3f882e3d64dc"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo09",
   "beat": "takeaway",
   "text": "Every follicle keeps its own schedule, so they never all let go at once.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "09.wav",
   "dur": 5.45,
   "sha256": "6eeb48a1f1a438d50ff2550cae7ff225df023f0c4281e7343d54bffa700cab71"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo10",
   "beat": "takeaway",
   "text": "Right now, you're losing hair, and growing it, at the same time.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "10.wav",
   "dur": 5.59,
   "sha256": "c3eadb29659b93c1cebcd91d18857f07e5d0e392bc349c03071447526b48edbf"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo11",
   "beat": "cta",
   "text": "If you're feeling a little calmer, tap like and follow.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "11.wav",
   "dur": 5.04,
   "sha256": "a72f846dedd4bafe3353a9f760309090c5311fcd62d46ad6121fb6e2aadbaa22"
  }
 ]
}